Alembic migration scaffold

Usage examples:
- alembic current
- alembic upgrade head
- alembic revision -m "add new index"

Current baseline flow:
1) Existing DBs created by SQLAlchemy metadata.create_all can be stamped to 20260226_0001.
2) New DBs should use alembic upgrade head.
3) Index additions are in 20260226_0002_add_hotspot_indexes.
